# Defense in depth. Nothing of these types has ever been committed and none is
# needed to build: the extension signing key lives in the Chrome Web Store and
# the packaged artifacts are produced into the ignored .output/ tree.
.env
.env.*
# The disposable-mainnet pilot's own storage: encrypted wallet records for a
# throwaway Spending wallet and a throwaway Vault role A, plus the plans it
# built. Operator state, never repository content.
.pilot-state/
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
*.crx
*.zip
